no source code is copied. Generated PAC vocabulary retains those SOURCE IDs.

Generated function ABI facts (Apache-2.0), from open ESP-IDF headers:
S31 at 4d80c1b29aeabc8e735ffc6e1be9bb23e95d1d5d and C5 at
4d59230ddff16327812782151ef0afef202dc6d7; no implementation code copied:

