Each function cites its header and line, with the header's SHA-256. The
companion file records the configuration hash and binary corpus hashes.


2. ESP32-S31 and ESP32-C5 SVDs (esp-pacs)
-----------------------------------------

Source:    https://github.com/esp-rs/esp-pacs at a1f6cf68e,
           esp32s31/svd/esp32s31.base.svd and esp32c5/svd/esp32c5.base.svd
Copyright: Espressif Systems (Shanghai) PTE LTD
License:   Apache-2.0

- chips/esp32c5/registers/upstream/esp32c5.svd: the vendor SVD, unmodified;
  the PAC's generated `soc` module is rendered from it.
- chips/esp32s31/registers/types/: the ESP32-S31 block types take register
  and field names, interrupt bindings and resets from esp32s31.base.svd as
  facts, each citing it; the SVD itself is not in this repository.


3. Espressif vendor libraries
-----------------------------

Sources:   https://github.com/espressif/esp-phy-lib at 20f1db05,
           https://github.com/espressif/esp32-wifi-lib at af55a0ca,
           https://github.com/espressif/esp-coex-lib at c758e7b5
Copyright: Espressif Systems (Shanghai) Co Ltd
License:   Apache-2.0 (each repository's LICENSE)

Recovered tables and coefficients (coexistence schemes and PTI, PHY gain and
power, Wi-Fi) in production source; the SOURCE line beside each names the
library, object and symbol. The same pins for both chips (ESP32-S31 and
ESP32-C5).

Translated and modified by Vladislav Ermachenkov; each function names the
vendor function it follows:

- chips/esp32s31/phy and the PHY modules of chips/esp32s31/hal,
  chips/esp32s31/pac, chips/esp32c5/hal and chips/esp32c5/pac: libphy.a
  calibration, tracking and analog-bus algorithms
- protocols/ieee80211/sta/src/modem_sleep.rs: libpp.a [pm.o] and
  [pm_coex.o], the station power manager
- chips/espressif/ieee80211-policy: libpp.a and libnet80211.a rate
  schedules, rate control, retry ladder and LMAC limits
- chips/espressif/coex: libcoexist.a coexistence schedule and event
  requests


