5. esp32s31-bt-lib
------------------

Source:    https://github.com/espressif/esp32s31-bt-lib at 7a85006f35f6839ae7ea5adee16e68a757759196
License:   Apache-2.0 (current binary distribution)

Existing derivations from unlicensed revision 10c50778 retain their source
attribution and the facts-only restrictions in docs/source-policy.md.

The Bluetooth LE hardware engine (the S31 driver, the HAL's controller-memory
engine, the PAC's Bluetooth initialization and the HAL's scheduler locks) keeps what it
takes from this library, under the exception in docs/source-policy.md.

Outside that engine, the repository records only facts from the library:
values, layouts, addresses, order of operations and names (the HAL and PAC,
chips/esp32s31/notes/bluetooth, chips/esp32s31/notes and the name maps
under chips/esp32s31/vendor/facts/names). It records neither code nor
verbatim data blocks outside the exception.

The standard PRBS payload generators in protocols/bluetooth/le/wire/src/dtm.rs
are checked against recovered LE test-payload fingerprints; the generators
implement Core Vol 6 Part F 4.1.5 and retain MIT OR Apache-2.0 licensing.


