9. wireless-regdb
-----------------

Source:    https://git.kernel.org/pub/scm/linux/kernel/git/wens/wireless-regdb.git
           at 389b9b702cf9018e9a9078ccc4fa8eaae2e054e3 (db.txt)
Copyright: Luis R. Rodriguez, Johannes Berg, Michael Green and contributors
License:   ISC (text below)

A generated subset of the regulatory rules (frequency spans, power limits and
flags of the listed countries) as data in
protocols/radio/regulatory/src/generated.rs, produced by
tools/regulatory/generate.


Not derived
-----------

Test vectors from IEEE Std 802.11 Annex J, RFC 3394 and the Bluetooth Core
sample data are facts and keep their citations. Bluetooth encryption samples
in protocols/bluetooth/le/cipher/src/tests.rs are from Core Vol 6 Part C.
Linux mac80211 (GPL-2.0) is cited for behaviour only: protocols/ieee80211/rsn/src/ccmp_mpdu.rs and
protocols/ieee80211/wire/src/data.rs implement the IEEE 802.11 rules
independently.


